      "writtenOn": "2022-11-24T10:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Shikha, sorry I just noticed this thread. Agree with Alan, and I also think it\u0027s better to use the name EncryptedStorage in other parts of the code. Because \"store\" usually implies some bundle of key/certificate artifacts in cryptography like truststore or keystore[1], it\u0027s not so intuitive to associate it with storage.\n\n[1] https://docs.oracle.com/cd/E19509-01/820-3503/ggffo/index.html",
      "parentUuid": "7e794c94_14b3e67d",
